BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8c84e7a9-da1b-39df-80b2-e9809056d333.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
